{"id":66719,"date":"2025-02-16T19:37:34","date_gmt":"2025-02-16T18:37:34","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=66719"},"modified":"2026-10-28T08:07:27","modified_gmt":"2026-10-28T07:07:27","slug":"sousoes-trail","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sousoes-trail\/","title":{"rendered":"Sous\u00f5es Trail 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Sous\u00f5es Trail 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Sous\u00f5es Trail 2026<\/strong> (4\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no domingo, <strong>22 de novembro de 2026<\/strong>, na cidade de <strong>Felgueiras<\/strong> (distrito do Porto), homenageando a hist\u00f3rica linhagem medieval dos Sous\u00f5es na regi\u00e3o de Entre-Douro-e-Minho.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Com partida e chegada no <strong>Parque Urbano da Bou\u00e7a<\/strong> (junto \u00e0 Biblioteca Municipal), os percursos atravessam as encostas e trilhos florestais do <strong>Vale do Bugio e Ferro<\/strong>, entre Jugueiros e Sendim, cruzando marcos da c\u00e9lebre <strong>Rota do Rom\u00e2nico<\/strong> e do Mosteiro de Pombeiro. Podes desafiar-te no <strong>Trail de 31 km<\/strong> (1455m D+, \u00e0s 09:00), no <strong>Trail de 17 km<\/strong> (815m D+, \u00e0s 09:30) ou na <strong>Caminhada de 11 km<\/strong> (600m D+, \u00e0s 10:00).<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pelo <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Felgueiras<\/strong>, o evento inclui camisola alusiva, pr\u00e9mio <em>finisher<\/em> (nas provas de 31 km e 17 km), abastecimentos, seguro, banhos no Pavilh\u00e3o Municipal de Moutelas e um pr\u00e9mio especial de um presunto inteiro e uma caixa de vinho para a equipa mais numerosa. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class