Fase (01\/09 a 15\/11):<\/strong> 17,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 15\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada 11K<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 22 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00 \u2022 600m D+<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase (01\/06 a 31\/08):<\/strong> 9,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31\/08\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase (01\/09 a 15\/11):<\/strong> 12,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 15\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Sous\u00f5es Trail 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 4\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Sous\u00f5es Trail realiza-se no domingo, 22 de novembro de 2026, com partida e chegada no Parque Urbano da Bou\u00e7a (junto \u00e0 Biblioteca Municipal, na Av. Dr. Magalh\u00e3es Lemos), em Felgueiras, distrito do Porto.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios de partida, dist\u00e2ncias e altimetrias?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Trail de 31 km (1455m D+, tempo m\u00e1ximo de 5h00) parte \u00e0s 09:00 (controlo zero \u00e0s 08:50); o Trail de 17 km (815m D+, tempo m\u00e1ximo de 3h30) parte \u00e0s 09:30 (controlo zero \u00e0s 09:20); e a Caminhada de 11 km (600m D+) parte \u00e0s 10:00. O fecho da meta ocorre \u00e0s 14:00.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem em 2 fases (1\u00aa fase de 01\/06 a 31\/08 e 2\u00aa fase de 01\/09 a 15\/11\/2026): Trail 31 km (16 \u20ac \/ 20 \u20ac), Trail 17 km (13 \u20ac \/ 17 \u20ac) e Caminhada 11 km (9 \u20ac \/ 12 \u20ac). Atletas federados na Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo do Porto (AAP) usufruem do valor da 1\u00aa fase at\u00e9 ao fecho das inscri\u00e7\u00f5es.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio exigido nas provas de 31 km e 17 km?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Em ambas as dist\u00e2ncias de trail \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio transportar dep\u00f3sito de \u00e1gua com capacidade m\u00ednima de 0,5 L, manta t\u00e9rmica, telem\u00f3vel operacional, apito, copo pr\u00f3prio (m\u00ednimo 15 cl, pois n\u00e3o h\u00e1 copos nos abastecimentos) e dorsal vis\u00edvel.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza o evento e onde funcionam o secretariado e os banhos?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova \u00e9 organizada pelo Munic\u00edpio de Felgueiras. O secretariado funciona no s\u00e1bado (21\/11, das 14:30 \u00e0s 18:30) e no domingo (22\/11, a partir das 07:30). Os banhos est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis no Pavilh\u00e3o Municipal de Moutelas (junto ao Quartel dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Felgueiras).<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Sous\u00f5es Trail 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-22\", \"endDate\": \"2026-11-22\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Felgueiras, Porto\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Felgueiras\", \"addressRegion\": \"Porto\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O Sous\u00f5es Trail 2026 realiza-se a 22 de novembro em Felgueiras, Porto. Percursos de Trail 31 km, 17 km e Caminhada 11 km pelo Vale do Bugio. Inscreve-te j\u00e1!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-sousoes-trail.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Sous\u00f5es Trail 31K\", \"price\": \"16.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/sousoestrail2026.statusmarathon.run\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Sous\u00f5es Trail 17K\", \"price\": \"13.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/sousoestrail2026.statusmarathon.run\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Caminhada 11K\", \"price\": \"9.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/sousoestrail2026.statusmarathon.run\"}]}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Sous\u00f5es Trail 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 4\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Sous\u00f5es Trail realiza-se no domingo, 22 de novembro de 2026, com partida e chegada no Parque Urbano da Bou\u00e7a (junto \u00e0 Biblioteca Municipal, na Av. Dr. Magalh\u00e3es Lemos), em Felgueiras, distrito do Porto.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios de partida, dist\u00e2ncias e altimetrias?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O Trail de 31 km (1455m D+, tempo m\u00e1ximo de 5h00) parte \u00e0s 09:00 (controlo zero \u00e0s 08:50); o Trail de 17 km (815m D+, tempo m\u00e1ximo de 3h30) parte \u00e0s 09:30 (controlo zero \u00e0s 09:20); e a Caminhada de 11 km (600m D+) parte \u00e0s 10:00. O fecho da meta ocorre \u00e0s 14:00.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem em 2 fases (1\u00aa fase de 01\/06 a 31\/08 e 2\u00aa fase de 01\/09 a 15\/11\/2026): Trail 31 km (16 \u20ac \/ 20 \u20ac), Trail 17 km (13 \u20ac \/ 17 \u20ac) e Caminhada 11 km (9 \u20ac \/ 12 \u20ac). Atletas federados na Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo do Porto (AAP) usufruem do valor da 1\u00aa fase at\u00e9 ao fecho das inscri\u00e7\u00f5es.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio exigido nas provas de 31 km e 17 km?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Em ambas as dist\u00e2ncias de trail \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio transportar dep\u00f3sito de \u00e1gua com capacidade m\u00ednima de 0,5 L, manta t\u00e9rmica, telem\u00f3vel operacional, apito, copo pr\u00f3prio (m\u00ednimo 15 cl, pois n\u00e3o h\u00e1 copos nos abastecimentos) e dorsal vis\u00edvel.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quem organiza o evento e onde funcionam o secretariado e os banhos?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova \u00e9 organizada pelo Munic\u00edpio de Felgueiras. O secretariado funciona no s\u00e1bado (21\/11, das 14:30 \u00e0s 18:30) e no domingo (22\/11, a partir das 07:30). Os banhos est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis no Pavilh\u00e3o Municipal de Moutelas (junto ao Quartel dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Felgueiras).\"}}]}<\/script>","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":71072,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,498],"event_type_2":[24,726,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-66719","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-felgueiras-porto","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-porto","event_type_2-porto-e-norte","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/sousoes-trail-2026.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/66719","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=66719"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/66719\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":70849,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/66719\/revisions\/70849"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/71072"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=66719"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.por